WEBVTT

00:00:00,880 --> 00:00:14,960
I've heard from a couple different sources though the benefit of a 21-day water

00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:20,720
fast for treating cancer. In one case I heard a tumor shrinkage about 50%

00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:25,960
within the 21 days. That was a colorectal tumor which is similar to what I

00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:33,440
have. I have also heard lower back pain from a prostate tumor going away

00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:38,220
completely within three days. Do you have comments on the value of a full

00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:47,480
water fast treatment for cancer symptoms? Well, I think we just addressed this

00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:53,220
question this last week too, that there's a plenty of evidence that doing

00:00:53,220 --> 00:01:02,600
fast over 24 hours increases in IGF1 levels which is a growth hormone factor

00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:08,360
which that's why most people don't recommend doing more than a 24-hour fast

00:01:08,360 --> 00:01:12,940
for cancer patients because it will increase IGF1 levels. But I have had

00:01:12,940 --> 00:01:18,980
patients that have done a 10-day fast, a 7-day fast, a 21-day fast, and even a 40-day

00:01:18,980 --> 00:01:22,980
fast and it really helped them. The only thing you have to really be careful of

00:01:22,980 --> 00:01:28,980
is the second half of this question. I am a 10-year-old person 615 pounds. That's

00:01:28,980 --> 00:01:34,420
pretty tiny. If you're doing a 21-day fast, you're definitely going to lose

00:01:34,420 --> 00:01:40,540
weight. I mean, definitely going to lose weight. And one of the worst things for

00:01:40,540 --> 00:01:46,020
a cancer patient is to fall into the trap of Cakesia, meaning that, oh my gosh, I'm

00:01:46,020 --> 00:01:52,820
down to 135 pounds and now I can't even put on weight. That is that can be a

00:01:52,820 --> 00:01:57,060
really bad thing for a cancer patient. That could be a tumble that you can't get

00:01:57,100 --> 00:02:06,500
on. So if you're thinking of trying a longer fast, whether it be three days, five

00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:11,660
days, seven days, ten days, or even something like this, I would say, don't try it

00:02:11,660 --> 00:02:17,900
unless you have some weight to lose. So, oh boy, I could lose 20 pounds and I

00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:23,660
would still be, you know, not be too thin. Well, then that can be something that you

00:02:23,660 --> 00:02:29,060
could pray about and try. Not against trying things that maybe go against some of

00:02:29,060 --> 00:02:32,840
the research out there. Hey, the research isn't perfect either. If you feel like

00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:37,340
God's leading you to something, try it. But you also got to be wise. And if you're at,

00:02:37,340 --> 00:02:43,020
you know, weight like this, I don't know that that's a wise thing to do. I would

00:02:43,020 --> 00:02:46,780
say that that would be my first go too.

